      "scope": "Implementation check of the owner seqlock. The generic lock macro is unchanged. CURRENT_HOLDER requires a matching even seq and ticket == current. HISTORICAL survives unlock. A plain two-field read and a historical certificate treated as current are negative controls. Seq wrap, uninstrumented acquire sites, and fault preservation are outside this check."
