      "scope": "Implementation check of the completed-operation seqlock. The record stores the elected operation kind and the VM round, not the flag and not the entry proposal. ABSENT is not idleness. COMPLETED_PAST survives return. A torn read, a flag-as-round sample, an entry-op publication, and a SAME_CYCLE inference are negative controls. Cohort overwrite beyond the upward wait, argument words, and fault preservation are outside this check."
